943: ## 8. Verification & Test Coverage Matrix
944: 
945: The automated test harness `tests/test-m3.js` (specified by `explorer_m3_3_gen2`) must validate the following requirements against this specification:
946: 
947: | Test ID | Test Category | Condition Tested | Expected Outcome |
948: |---|---|---|---|
949: | `NAV-01` | Directional Movement | Move Right in shelf row | Moves from Card 1 to Card 2, orthogonal distance 0 |
950: | `NAV-02` | Directional Movement | Move Left in shelf row | Moves from Card 2 to Card 1 |
951: | `NAV-03` | Vertical Navigation | Move Down between shelf rows | Column alignment preserved via X-overlap |
952: | `NAV-04` | Asymmetric Cone | Move Down from Header Pill to Hero | Pass 2 half-plane activates, focuses Hero Play button |
953: | `NAV-05` | Dead-End Boundary | Move Left on Card 1 | Focus retained on Card 1, `'deadend'` event emitted |
954: | `NAV-06` | Candidate Filter | Hidden elements (`display: none`) | Completely ignored during candidate discovery |
955: | `NAV-07` | Candidate Filter | Inactive views (`.view:not(.active)`) | Candidates in other views excluded |
956: | `NAV-08` | Focus Memory (Clean) | Switch Home -> Movies -> Home | Returns to exact Card previously focused on Home |
957: | `NAV-09` | Focus Memory (Detached) | Stored card detached by re-render | Falls back to Group+Index or Group+Title |
958: | `NAV-10` | Focus Trapping | `trap(keyboard)` active | Arrow keys stay strictly inside keyboard keys |
959: | `NAV-11` | Overlap Priority | Lateral element vs Diagonal element | Candidate with lateral overlap wins decisively |
960: | `NAV-12` | Tie Breaking | Equidistant grid candidates | Candidate with higher overlap or DOM precedence wins |
